  </div>

<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Roland Mikler">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/ovth3exo/se20261022_szeged_gog_35.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/ovth3exo/se20261022_szeged_gog_35.jpg"
                         alt="SE20261022 Szeged GOG 35 (1)">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
We’re disappointed. We wanted to control the game, but we couldn’t, and we only managed to fight our way back towards the end. I’m sorry we couldn’t get the win in front of nearly 6,000 fans. Everyone gave it their all, and we fought until the very last moment, but even that wasn’t enough.            </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Roland Mikler</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Goalkeeper of OTP Bank - PICK Szeged</div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Kasper Christensen">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/ao3jtt1x/se20261022_szeged_gog_27.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/ao3jtt1x/se20261022_szeged_gog_27.jpg"
                         alt="SE20261022 Szeged GOG 27 (1)">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
It was a great match, and the fans created a fantastic atmosphere. We’re proud to have qualified for the next round. It was a tough game: we were in control early on, then Szeged took the initiative, but in the end, we can be happy with the result.            </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Kasper Christensen</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Head Coach of GOG</div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

