  <div class="container-full-width container--padding" >
    <div class="content-container container-sm">
      <div class="content-block">
        <div class="editor-output editor-output--responsive-img js-consent-content" data-purposes="3">
          <h3><a data-router-slot="disabled" href="https://ehfcl.eurohandball.com/men/2026-27/matches/details/202711020101041/SportingClubedePortugal-IFKKristianstad/" title="ehfcl.eurohandball.com" type="external">Sporting Clube de Portugal (POR) vs IFK Kristianstad (SWE) 42:40 (20:18)</a></h3><p>H2H: 4-0-0<br>Top scorer: Francisco Costa 14/16 (Sporting Clube de Portugal), Baldur Bjarnasson 11/13 (IFK Kristianstad)</p><p>More or less, it was a match played for pride, as the major decisions in the group had already been taken after GOG secured the second main round spot earlier in the evening. Nevertheless, both sides produced an entertaining encounter with the focus firmly on attack and goals rather than defence. The Costa brothers, Francisco (six goals) and Martim (four), scored exactly 50 per cent of Sporting's goals before the break, but IFK Kristianstad remained competitive and stayed within striking distance, mainly thanks to their top scorers William Höghielm and Baldur Bjarnasson, who scored five goals each in the first half. The second half became something of a duel between Francisco Costa and Kristianstad. "Kiko" kept finding the net, but the Swedish champions refused to go away and cut the deficit to 32:31. In the end, they were only beaten by two goals.</p>
        </div>


<div class="consent-info js-consent-info" data-purposes="3">
    <div class="consent-info-content">
        <h2>This content is blocked</h2>
        <p>You said no to using cookies or similar tools that help improve your experience. To see this content, you would need to update your <a href="javascript:void(0);" class="iubenda-cs-preferences-link">Privacy Preferences</a>.</p>
        <button class="iubenda-cs-preferences-link" data-accept-purposes="3">
            Update
        </button>
    </div>
</div>      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Ricardo Costa">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/wrzcybba/20261022_sportingcp_ifkkristianstad-6191.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/wrzcybba/20261022_sportingcp_ifkkristianstad-6191.jpg"
                         alt="20261022 SPORTINGCP IFKKRISTIANSTAD 6191">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
I liked the win and our attack but I don’t remember when was the last time that we conceded 40 goals. It was a game with little on the line for both teams but a win on the Champions League is something always good. Every game counts and we have to be better, but sometimes there are games like this.            </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Ricardo Costa</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Head coach of Sporting CP</div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Bjorn Satherstrom">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/dxkhfoqd/20261022_sportingcp_ifkkristianstad-7006.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/dxkhfoqd/20261022_sportingcp_ifkkristianstad-7006.jpg"
                         alt="20261022 SPORTINGCP IFKKRISTIANSTAD 7006 (1)">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
We developed in a good way. We played really good defence even tough we conceded a lot of goals. We played a good game overall, it was close, but in the end Sporting were stronger. We never gave up.            </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Bjorn Satherstrom</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Head coach of IFK Kristianstad</div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

