  </div>

<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Timothey N&#x2019;Guessan">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/vy5grqa1/2026-10-22_fcbhandbolvsmontpellier_015.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/vy5grqa1/2026-10-22_fcbhandbolvsmontpellier_015.jpg"
                         alt="2026 10 22 Fcbhandbolvsmontpellier 015">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
I’m happy for the win. We’re playing good right now. We played better in the second half and that&#39;s the way for us. Montpellier always make things difficult for us. Today they had less pressure with their absences, so I expected a tough game like it was.            </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Timothey N&#x2019;Guessan</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Left back of Bar&#xE7;a </div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Pol Valera">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/zqkjusn0/2026-10-22_fcbhandbolvsmontpellier_006.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/zqkjusn0/2026-10-22_fcbhandbolvsmontpellier_006.jpg"
                         alt="2026 10 22 Fcbhandbolvsmontpellier 006">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
We had a lot of injured players and our streak lately wasn&#39;t good. But those who were today on the court gave everything and that&#39;s the way. Unfortunately we got eliminated from EHFCL and that&#39;s a pity, as for the team and as for the club.            </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Pol Valera</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Centre back of Montpellier Handball</div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

