      <div class="content-block">
        <div class="editor-output editor-output--responsive-img js-consent-content" data-purposes="3">
          <p>GROUP F</p><h3><a data-router-slot="disabled" href="https://ehfcl.eurohandball.com/men/2026-27/matches/details/202711020101064/KolstadH%C3%A5ndball-SCMagdeburg/" title="ehfcl.eurohandball.com" type="external">Kolstad Håndball (NOR) vs SC Magdeburg (GER) 32:35 (15:15)</a></h3><p>H2H: 1-0-2<br>Top scorer: Simon Jeppson 10/14 (Kolstad Håndball), Philipp Weber 11/14 (SC Magdeburg)</p><p>Kolstad Håndball wanted to reward their fans with their first points in what was their last home match of the season, having already been eliminated from main round contention. But one good half was not enough. The stakes were relatively low for SC Magdeburg, who had already secured their place in the main round and will carry the maximum four points into the next stage. Therefore, coach Bennet Wiegert handed plenty of playing time to young talents such as M18 EHF EURO champions Tim Thielicke and Malte Elze. The most intriguing storyline of the match was a kind of private shoot-out between Kolstad’s Simon Jeppson and Philipp Weber of Magdeburg to become the top scorer of the night, eventually won by the German. The hosts did not trail until Magdeburg took an 19:18 lead in the 35th minute. As Kolstad’s shooting efficiency gradually declined against goalkeeper Dominik Kuzmanović, SCM steadily pulled away. Weber’s 11th goal, which made it 32:26, effectively sealed the result. Like One Veszprém HC and Barça, Magdeburg remain one of only three teams with a perfect record after five matches.</p><p><span class="umb-embed-holder" data-embed-constrain="true" data-embed-height="393" data-embed-url="https://youtu.be/aZXsEiqNEK8?si=BGSww0oFfYUBbjjb" data-embed-width="700"><iframe width="699" height="393" class="_iub_cs_activate" data-iub-purposes="3" data-suppressedsrc="https://www.youtube.com/embed/aZXsEiqNEK8?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen="" title="Kolstad Håndball vs SC Magdeburg | Highlights | EHF Champions League Men 2026/27"></iframe></span></p>
        </div>


