<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Stian Gomo Nilsen">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/jy4fsds5/20261022_kolstad_sc_magdeburg_43.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/jy4fsds5/20261022_kolstad_sc_magdeburg_43.jpg"
                         alt="20261022 Kolstad SC Magdeburg 43">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
We put in a good effort today, against the world&#39;s best handball team. Of course Magdeburg is saving some players, but we stand up and keep fighting. We were focused on not letting ourselves get broken, and I think we held up pretty well. I wish Magdeburg the best of luck going forward!            </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Stian Gomo Nilsen</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position">Head coach, Kolstad H&#xE5;ndball</div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container-full-width container--padding">
    <div class="container">
        <blockquote class="blockquote blockquote--fullwidth" cite="Bennet Wiegert">
                <div class="blockquote-img-tag-container">
                    <img class="img-responsive blockquote-image" data-loading="lazy"
                         src="/media/1kyflhr1/20260811goscmmin1084.jpg"
                         data-src="/media/1kyflhr1/20260811goscmmin1084.jpg"
                         alt="20260811GOSCMMIN1084">
                </div>
            <div class="blockquote-text">
Really happy and proud to take another win in our group. We are happy to take the win and now we are looking to a tough match in the German Bundesliga this weekend. The traveling is tough, so we have to take good advantage of all the time we have.            </div>
            <div class="blockquote-author">
                <div class="blockquote-name">Bennet Wiegert</div>
                <div class="blockquote-position"></div>
            </div>
        </blockquote>
    </div>
</div>

